 fill=\"#79b7c5\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"862\" y=\"297\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#dda074\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"891\" y=\"297\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" fill=\"#79b7c5\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"908\" y=\"302\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" fill=\"#dda074\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"688\" y=\"354\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"system-ui,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"640\" fill=\"#577787\">Feature units don't align</text></svg></div><p class=\"mm-note\">A changed distribution is a warning; it does not automatically prove a model is inaccurate.</p></section>"
